{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2006_CyMO-19.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/2/2d/2006_CyMO-19.PNG/250px-2006_CyMO-19.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"302\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/2/2d/2006_CyMO-19.PNG/375px-2006_CyMO-19.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/2/2d/2006_CyMO-19.PNG 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>In the figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/6/4369ccb938d86d296fe34bff83b078419be8aaf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> is an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Isosceles_triangle\" title=\"Isosceles triangle\">isosceles triangle</a> with<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b04855281fa55ae7f96062b701a90da5730f89a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=A\\Gamma=\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd3366b960c9dd6727bd67be1db43ab9c89e7649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A=45^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1b046b85abfa379dbbd1a83d2e876fbeb6ab0ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B\\Delta$\" width=\"29\" height=\"13\" /> is an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Altitude\" title=\"Altitude\">altitude</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangle</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sector\" title=\"Sector\">sector</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/09463852491c254d45f2d69dc71ad32c0eb2fc77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B\\Lambda \\Delta KB$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> belongs to the circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/f/9bf6af1e14b30fe6cdd9605213443cdc8fe1de51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(B,B\\Delta )$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Area\" title=\"Area\">area</a> of the shaded region is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26ead968682626708403382b3cc2aa70133426dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{4\\sqrt3-\\pi}{6}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 4\\left(\\sqrt2-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{8\\sqrt2-3\\pi}{16}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{\\pi}{8}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"658\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/f/41fd57e75e9847249cf7ab59c7ec17bddba4aca9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A  \\Delta B$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangle</a> with an angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/821d3f11ab7a3e93c7a404a34224228f0449505a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, so it is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/22231a5cdd4fe05a11f4b577e3b81221f3017a85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45-45-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"13\" /> triangle with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3ed3e24a716124f3778e0ceb1001452adf11b5f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B\\Delta = \\frac{AB}{\\sqrt{2}} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"118\" height=\"42\" />.\n</p><p>The area of the entire circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40e93f6a9a26adb60468f366e7bf3e9cd5f10713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)^2\\pi = \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"19\" />. The central angle of the sector is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/6/c46644c045f1a80fed04efaa1cb12f107d6c744f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{180-45}{2} = \\frac{135}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"125\" height=\"37\" />, so the area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d928d62661556fbfac63af82b9ea327b6af9419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{135}{2}}{360}\\pi = \\frac{3}{16}\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>The area of the entire triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/6/93607b0baf90631e125797882613228e0de9fe87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}bh = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"82\" height=\"41\" />. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71de090a54d4541180c5f276b68c0af99ef574b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} - \\frac{3}{16}\\pi = \\frac{8\\sqrt{2} - 3\\pi}{16} \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"252\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=20